                                </h4>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                                    Define seat quotas per department (e.g. 5 Customer Service, 2 Quality Assurance). The algorithm automatically prioritizes candidates who have <strong>never attended first</strong>, rotating staff fairly across upcoming sessions.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Presets bar: Saved Rules -->
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 p-3.5 bg-slate-50/80 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/70">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 w-full sm:w-auto flex-1">
